	class L3138
	{
		text="THERE�S A LITTLE EASTER EGG FOR MOVING INDIVIDUAL UNITS. LEFT CLICK ON ONE OF YOUR UNITS, KEEP YOUR MOUSE PRESSED DOWN AND DRAW A PATH ON THE MAP BY DRAGGING THE MOUSE AROUND.";
