	class LSMHC25
	{
		text="JUST AS ON SQUAD LEVEL, THE �FIRE SUPPORT� ACTION CREATES A POLYGON TO DETERMINE THE AREA TO BE FIRED AT. ADJUST THE SETTINGS TO YOUR LIKING";
